        <mxCell id="p8_n42" value="Rows: PK primary key | FK foreign key (? = nullable) | FK* typed composite FK | UK unique | CK check. Parent end of a line is the start, child end is the crow-foot end. Every hospital-owned table has FK hospital_id to hospitals and every hospital-to-hospital FK is composite with hospital_id; these are listed as rows, not drawn as lines. Columns named recorded_by / performed_by are FKs to hospital_users shown as annotated rows. Teal outline = nurse and staff workflow. Many-to-many appears through junction tables (italic header)." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
